###
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="Frodo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./images/users/Frodo.png
--MyBoundary--

###
